WEBVTT

00:11.716 --> 00:14.947
Hanaukyo Maid Team

00:15.920 --> 00:21.688
Open a window in the morning.

00:21.759 --> 00:28.790
Flowers of light
surround the world.

00:29.367 --> 00:35.272
As if the hidden
feeling in my heart...

00:35.340 --> 00:42.803
...is melting away now.

00:43.348 --> 00:48.308
I'm holding
the fragrance of the season.

00:49.721 --> 00:55.956
I pray to you...

00:56.027 --> 00:58.962
I wanted to meet you...

00:59.030 --> 01:02.625
...ever since the day I was born.

01:02.700 --> 01:05.635
Only you...

01:05.703 --> 01:10.140
...I want to protect only you.

01:10.208 --> 01:12.506
Just you...

01:12.577 --> 01:14.772
...I want to touch.

01:15.913 --> 01:21.044
My hand is going to hold you.

01:22.687 --> 01:24.655
I want to deliver.

01:25.923 --> 01:28.448
Voice of my heart.

01:36.634 --> 01:38.033
I'm tired...

01:38.102 --> 01:41.936
Good night kiss,
kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss!

01:43.641 --> 01:44.608
Huh?

01:44.675 --> 01:46.404
At this time of night?

01:46.477 --> 01:47.444
Cynthia.

01:50.515 --> 01:51.948
You're Taro, huh?

01:53.518 --> 01:56.351
Jeez, you're easygoing,
aren't you.

01:58.856 --> 01:59.845
Um...

01:59.924 --> 02:04.793
Well, I'll protect the Hanaukyo
family, so don't worry.

02:06.531 --> 02:07.498
See ya.

02:12.303 --> 02:17.206
Cynthia and Grace

02:23.281 --> 02:25.613
I think that's
probably Grace-chan.

02:26.484 --> 02:27.712
Grace?

02:27.785 --> 02:29.047
Yes.

02:29.120 --> 02:33.648
The other personality that
wakes as Cynthia-chan sleeps.

02:33.724 --> 02:35.555
That is Grace-chan.

02:36.427 --> 02:39.191
Cynthia-chan was born a prodigy.

02:40.064 --> 02:41.031
But...

02:43.367 --> 02:46.962
Are you going to use Cynthia
to make more money?

02:47.038 --> 02:48.005
You too.

02:48.072 --> 02:50.939
You'll make her work
while you do nothing, right?

02:52.410 --> 02:54.310
You're making money with her!

02:55.746 --> 02:58.909
You are a chosen one.

02:58.983 --> 03:04.285
If you study hard, I'm sure
your papa and mama will return.

03:14.132 --> 03:16.726
After all,
a normal child is the best.

03:16.801 --> 03:19.827
Yes, it was all her fault.

03:19.904 --> 03:21.565
That's enough...

03:21.639 --> 03:23.004
Let's forget.

03:33.551 --> 03:35.576
You don't have to cry anymore.

03:37.054 --> 03:39.887
I'm Grace, another you.

03:40.591 --> 03:43.424
I'll protect you from today.

04:01.045 --> 04:02.034
Ever since...

04:02.113 --> 04:05.913
...Cynthia-chan remained an
innocent child befitting her age.

04:05.983 --> 04:09.783
Grace-chan became
responsible for her genius...

04:09.854 --> 04:12.322
...and the memories
of her dark past.

04:13.658 --> 04:15.091
So that's it.

04:16.027 --> 04:21.055
Grace-chan always says,
"I'm going to protect Cynthia."

04:21.132 --> 04:24.260
"I won't let Cynthia
face hardship anymore."

04:27.505 --> 04:28.472
For me?

04:36.180 --> 04:37.943
It looks good on you.

04:40.851 --> 04:42.944
Cynthia, do you like Grace?

04:46.123 --> 04:47.090
I see.

04:53.631 --> 04:54.723
Yeah.

04:54.799 --> 04:55.766
That's true.

05:09.380 --> 05:10.608
Good evening.

05:12.049 --> 05:13.414
Hi.

05:13.484 --> 05:15.008
It's you...

05:15.086 --> 05:17.486
What is it? You surprised me.

05:18.322 --> 05:21.291
Well, I can't sleep...

05:21.359 --> 05:24.328
Can we talk for a little while?

05:25.196 --> 05:26.561
I can't.

05:26.631 --> 05:29.498
I have a job to do starting now.

05:29.567 --> 05:30.534
Job?

05:32.870 --> 05:35.839
You don't know anything, do you...

05:35.906 --> 05:37.168
Oh, well.

05:37.241 --> 05:38.265
Follow me.

05:42.913 --> 05:44.107
This is...

05:44.181 --> 05:46.172
The deepest part of the mansion.

05:46.250 --> 05:47.842
It's my workplace.

05:50.554 --> 05:52.317
This is a subroom.

05:52.390 --> 05:56.349
It has complete control over
data processing and power.

05:58.296 --> 06:00.321
Grace-sama,
all systems are nominal.

06:00.398 --> 06:01.160
Good.

06:05.970 --> 06:07.232
Memol...

06:07.305 --> 06:08.067
Yeah.

06:13.311 --> 06:17.111
This is the main computer that's
the hub of the Hanaukyo family.

06:17.181 --> 06:20.582
When this is finished,
its great arithmetic capacity...

06:20.651 --> 06:23.484
...will put politics and
economics at our fingertips.

06:23.554 --> 06:24.521
Hmm...

06:26.223 --> 06:27.781
You went "hmm"?

06:27.858 --> 06:30.418
Do you understand
what this means?

06:30.494 --> 06:34.328
It means I can
control this world at will.

06:34.398 --> 06:35.524
Is that so?

06:35.599 --> 06:36.657
Enough.

06:36.734 --> 06:38.361
Idiots should go back!

06:38.436 --> 06:39.960
I'm busy.

06:42.273 --> 06:45.902
But don't you need
a break once in a while?

06:46.610 --> 06:49.272
If you stay locked
in a place like this...

06:49.347 --> 06:50.871
...you'll get suffocated.

06:51.916 --> 06:53.713
You're always alone, right?

06:53.784 --> 06:55.877
It doesn't bother me.

06:56.854 --> 06:59.322
We're all going on a picnic soon.

06:59.390 --> 07:01.449
- Why don't you come...
- I can't accept.

07:01.525 --> 07:04.722
I'm not interested
in such childish play.

07:04.795 --> 07:06.387
But...

07:06.464 --> 07:09.831
If you want to play,
play with Cynthia.

07:09.900 --> 07:11.390
She'll be happy.

07:12.203 --> 07:13.170
I see...

07:13.237 --> 07:14.499
I understand.

07:21.912 --> 07:23.470
A picnic, huh?

07:28.352 --> 07:29.785
Cynthia?

07:29.854 --> 07:31.651
What is it all of the sudden...

07:32.923 --> 07:36.051
I am deputy security
staff chief, Yashima Sanae.

07:36.127 --> 07:38.095
During Konoe's business trip...

07:38.162 --> 07:39.959
...I'm in charge of command.

07:40.030 --> 07:41.088
Yes, ma'am!

07:41.899 --> 07:43.457
Even with our Leader's absence...

07:43.534 --> 07:45.934
...there shouldn't be slip-ups
in the security!

07:46.003 --> 07:47.937
Prepare yourselves, everyone!

07:48.005 --> 07:49.029
Yes, ma'am!

07:49.740 --> 07:52.300
I'd better not make
any mistakes at all...

07:52.376 --> 07:56.574
If I do a perfect job during
Konoe-shama's absence...

08:02.119 --> 08:05.611
Oh, Konoe-shama!

08:05.689 --> 08:09.090
But Taro-sama has
already gone out today...

08:09.160 --> 08:10.388
Gone out?

08:17.468 --> 08:19.095
It's beautiful, isn't it?

08:19.170 --> 08:19.898
Yes.

08:22.606 --> 08:23.868
Well, Grace?

08:25.042 --> 08:27.567
You knew, after all...

08:27.645 --> 08:30.580
To tell the truth,
Cynthia asked me.

08:30.648 --> 08:33.412
To take Grace out and have fun.

08:33.484 --> 08:34.542
I see.

08:34.618 --> 08:36.347
That's why Cynthia...

08:37.455 --> 08:40.117
You want me to go
picnic in your place?

08:40.191 --> 08:41.419
Why?

08:43.828 --> 08:47.423
It's a rare opportunity,
so let's have fun this one day.

08:47.498 --> 08:49.022
We have lunch, too...

08:49.099 --> 08:50.691
Please eat a lot.

08:53.070 --> 08:55.038
Jeez, you guys are hopeless...

08:55.105 --> 08:56.333
Ow.

08:56.407 --> 08:58.034
I'm sorry!

08:58.108 --> 09:00.269
Please throw it back!

09:00.344 --> 09:04.041
It's only for one day today, right?

09:41.952 --> 09:44.819
It's already time to go, isn't it?

09:44.889 --> 09:45.856
Yes.

09:45.923 --> 09:47.584
Quit fooling around!

09:48.325 --> 09:51.453
When was I completely into it?

09:51.529 --> 09:52.553
Hey, answer!

09:52.630 --> 09:54.530
- You were.
- Come on...

09:54.598 --> 09:58.193
Especially when you
were playing cat's cradle.

09:58.269 --> 09:59.861
Grace.

09:59.937 --> 10:01.564
It's time to go home.

10:02.606 --> 10:03.595
You're right...

10:04.642 --> 10:07.634
The sun's about to set, too...

10:07.711 --> 10:09.201
Let's come again.

10:09.280 --> 10:10.804
I'll go anytime...

10:10.881 --> 10:12.109
Don't be silly.

10:12.182 --> 10:14.582
I told you only today.

10:14.652 --> 10:16.119
I'm busy.

10:17.621 --> 10:22.285
Instead, make sure
to bring Cynthia next time...

10:22.359 --> 10:24.554
It's unfair, isn't it?

10:24.628 --> 10:27.028
Grace, you like Cynthia, don't you?

10:29.867 --> 10:31.357
You blushed.

10:31.435 --> 10:32.629
Shut up!

10:35.272 --> 10:39.174
In any case, I'll tell Cynthia.

10:39.243 --> 10:40.505
So...

10:40.578 --> 10:42.671
Do you understand?

10:42.746 --> 10:44.441
Yeah, I promise.

10:49.386 --> 10:50.910
What?

10:50.988 --> 10:52.956
He went out today, too?

10:53.023 --> 10:55.150
Yes, I heard to a picnic...

10:55.225 --> 11:00.720
Jeez, without any notice to
the deputy security chief...

11:10.074 --> 11:13.566
Cynthia, you're good at
making flower decorations, huh?

11:15.579 --> 11:17.843
Who will you give it to this time?

11:17.915 --> 11:19.041
Mariel?

11:24.188 --> 11:25.450
Oh, I see.

11:31.795 --> 11:33.854
- Cynthia!
- Cynthia-chan!

11:39.903 --> 11:45.205
Hanaukyo Maid Team

11:47.811 --> 11:49.711
Medical Office

11:52.149 --> 11:53.514
Fatigue?

11:54.184 --> 11:57.415
Yes, according to
the medical staff's exams...

11:57.488 --> 11:59.581
...she suffers from
serious fatigue.

12:00.624 --> 12:05.220
But Grace was trying not
to impose a burden on Cynthia.

12:05.295 --> 12:08.856
At the picnic, she was
trying not to overdo it...

12:08.932 --> 12:13.096
She's accumulated the fatigue
little by little up till now.

12:14.138 --> 12:15.400
I see...

12:16.273 --> 12:20.903
To tell the truth, this has
been an issue for some time.

12:20.978 --> 12:23.572
With two personalities...

12:23.647 --> 12:27.777
...Cynthia-chan's body won't be
able to hold up in the near future.

12:29.453 --> 12:30.886
That can't be...

12:30.954 --> 12:32.581
Isn't there a way to save her?

12:32.656 --> 12:35.454
According to
the medical staff's exams...

12:35.526 --> 12:38.051
...only by integrating
the personalities.

12:38.128 --> 12:40.153
Integrate personalities?

12:41.331 --> 12:45.131
To eliminate Grace-chan's
personality, leaving one.

12:46.170 --> 12:51.335
Soon after Grace-chan's genius
becomes unnecessary...

12:51.408 --> 12:53.672
In other words,
when Memol is finished...

12:53.744 --> 12:56.975
...we want to integrate her
personalities soon after.

13:05.689 --> 13:08.453
Why am I sleeping
in a place like this?

13:08.525 --> 13:10.322
Hey, anyone here?

13:16.233 --> 13:17.996
I wonder what happened?

13:21.171 --> 13:22.138
This is...

13:23.173 --> 13:25.403
Integrate personalities?

13:25.476 --> 13:29.412
To eliminate Grace-chan's
personality, leaving one.

13:29.480 --> 13:33.678
Soon after Grace-chan's genius
becomes unnecessary...

13:33.751 --> 13:35.013
Grace.

13:35.085 --> 13:36.780
W-What is it?

13:36.854 --> 13:37.980
Well...

13:38.055 --> 13:40.387
You weren't in
the medical office...

13:40.457 --> 13:42.322
...so I figured you were here.

13:42.392 --> 13:44.257
I'm all right now.

13:44.328 --> 13:47.559
Cynthia also said
she just felt dizzy.

13:48.599 --> 13:50.294
I see...

13:50.367 --> 13:52.392
Then I'm relieved...

13:56.573 --> 13:58.040
U-Um...

13:58.108 --> 14:00.099
I told you I'm all right!

14:00.177 --> 14:01.667
I'm busy.

14:01.745 --> 14:02.871
Get out.

14:05.315 --> 14:06.077
Okay.

14:10.020 --> 14:10.987
Taro.

14:13.090 --> 14:16.617
You took Cynthia
out for a picnic, right?

14:19.029 --> 14:19.996
Yeah.

14:21.231 --> 14:25.327
Take care of Cynthia
from now on, too.

14:38.615 --> 14:39.775
Taro-sama.

14:41.218 --> 14:42.185
Mariel.

14:45.088 --> 14:47.181
Let me make some tea.

14:50.828 --> 14:52.318
Where's Grace?

14:52.396 --> 14:54.864
Well, she is still with Memol...

14:55.933 --> 15:00.029
I... need to help Grace.

15:01.572 --> 15:03.597
But I don't know what to do...

15:04.508 --> 15:06.874
I need to say something...

15:06.944 --> 15:11.005
I need to say something to her,
but I couldn't say anything...

15:11.081 --> 15:12.446
I...

15:12.516 --> 15:13.642
Taro-sama...

15:17.054 --> 15:18.612
I wonder what's happening?

15:18.689 --> 15:19.656
Master!

15:21.725 --> 15:22.885
Yashima-san.

15:24.061 --> 15:26.029
Please evacuate at once!

15:26.096 --> 15:28.621
Memol has gone berserk!

15:28.699 --> 15:29.927
Memol?

15:30.000 --> 15:32.696
What about Grace?
Wasn't she inside?

15:32.769 --> 15:34.100
Yes...

15:34.171 --> 15:35.297
But...

15:36.273 --> 15:39.800
Grace-sama is the one
who made it go berserk.

15:40.811 --> 15:42.108
It can't be...

15:42.179 --> 15:44.647
We don't know the details.

15:44.715 --> 15:48.651
But Grace-sama locked
the door on her own...

15:48.719 --> 15:51.210
...and continues
to isolate herself now.

15:52.256 --> 15:53.689
Master, hurry!

15:55.192 --> 15:56.159
No...

15:58.528 --> 16:01.224
I'm going to Grace.

16:01.298 --> 16:02.424
Taro-sama...

16:03.667 --> 16:05.635
No, you can't!

16:05.702 --> 16:07.761
I can't allow you to go
somewhere so dangerous...

16:08.972 --> 16:11.566
I want to help the two of them.

16:11.642 --> 16:12.609
No!

16:12.676 --> 16:14.667
As deputy security chief...

16:17.214 --> 16:18.545
Taro-sama.

16:18.615 --> 16:21.550
Cynthia-chan and Grace-chan...

16:21.618 --> 16:23.518
Please take care of them.

16:23.587 --> 16:24.554
Yeah.

16:40.137 --> 16:41.570
Taro...

16:41.638 --> 16:42.400
Grace.

16:44.641 --> 16:46.131
Really...

16:46.209 --> 16:48.871
It was about to be completed...

16:48.946 --> 16:50.174
But I failed...

16:51.181 --> 16:53.809
Grace, can you open the door?

16:53.884 --> 16:54.851
I won't.

16:56.019 --> 16:58.010
Don't panic every time.

16:59.056 --> 17:01.422
I just made a little mistake.

17:01.491 --> 17:04.551
I'll repair it right away
and complete it for sure.

17:04.628 --> 17:05.595
Then...

17:06.563 --> 17:07.530
Then...

17:08.598 --> 17:10.793
...integrate the personalities.

17:13.236 --> 17:14.533
You heard us...

17:15.572 --> 17:17.631
I knew it from the beginning.

17:20.610 --> 17:23.511
One body with two personalities...

17:23.580 --> 17:26.140
We'd break down some day.

17:26.216 --> 17:28.707
In order to save Cynthia...

17:28.785 --> 17:31.413
...I have to disappear.

17:32.456 --> 17:34.617
Will that make Cynthia happy?

17:35.659 --> 17:37.149
Yeah.

17:37.227 --> 17:38.353
Grace!

17:49.706 --> 17:51.196
The lock is released!

17:52.376 --> 17:54.139
The genius...

17:54.211 --> 17:57.408
The bad experiences...
The harsh memories...

17:57.481 --> 18:01.178
Cynthia is better off without them.

18:02.786 --> 18:04.913
If I disappear...

18:04.988 --> 18:08.685
...Cynthia can truly become
an innocent and pure child.

18:10.293 --> 18:13.558
It's obvious that
it's better that way...

18:13.630 --> 18:14.756
You're wrong.

18:18.235 --> 18:21.636
There's no way that
will make Cynthia happy.

18:22.839 --> 18:23.999
Taro...

18:25.342 --> 18:27.742
It's better if Grace disappears?

18:27.811 --> 18:29.540
That's wrong.

18:29.613 --> 18:30.580
Go back.

18:31.515 --> 18:32.482
Go back!

18:40.557 --> 18:42.252
Do you know what this is?

18:43.293 --> 18:47.855
Cynthia made this for Grace.

18:49.533 --> 18:51.467
To thank Grace...

18:51.535 --> 18:53.799
Because she likes
Grace very much...

18:58.008 --> 19:01.705
It's better if Grace disappears?

19:01.778 --> 19:02.767
That's just wrong.

19:12.756 --> 19:14.189
What should I do...

19:16.059 --> 19:18.857
What should I...

19:20.030 --> 19:21.861
What should I do?

19:24.334 --> 19:25.596
Taro...

19:25.669 --> 19:28.001
I don't know
whether this is correct.

19:29.039 --> 19:31.007
But I...

19:31.942 --> 19:32.909
No.

19:34.344 --> 19:39.839
I, Cynthia, Mariel,
Ikuyo-chan, everyone...

19:42.452 --> 19:45.853
Everyone wants
Grace to stay forever.

19:47.824 --> 19:48.950
Taro...

19:54.731 --> 19:57.256
It seems to have calmed down.

19:58.301 --> 19:59.268
Yes.

20:21.658 --> 20:23.990
It's a nice day today too, isn't it?

20:24.060 --> 20:25.049
Yes.

20:25.128 --> 20:27.426
Then Taro-sama
comes running in.

20:28.698 --> 20:30.063
Grace, open up!

20:30.934 --> 20:33.232
Taro! Why are you here?

20:34.237 --> 20:36.705
I want to save you, Grace.

20:37.507 --> 20:38.474
Taro...

20:40.210 --> 20:41.177
Grace...

20:42.746 --> 20:45.715
Thunk, the two held
each other tightly.

20:45.782 --> 20:47.977
Oh, that Grace-sama did that?

20:49.019 --> 20:52.455
She's known among the
information staff for being strict.

20:52.522 --> 20:54.046
She's a child, after all...

20:54.124 --> 20:55.091
But...

20:56.092 --> 20:58.322
I envy her!

21:00.030 --> 21:00.997
Huh?

21:01.064 --> 21:02.326
Ikuyo-san?

21:12.409 --> 21:14.639
What's the matter, Cynthia-chan?

21:15.512 --> 21:16.672
You're mistaken.

21:17.647 --> 21:21.640
Teach me how
to make flower decorations...

21:24.654 --> 21:25.621
Sure.

21:46.142 --> 21:49.441
Please leave everything to us.

21:49.512 --> 21:52.106
Hanaukyo Maid Team.

21:52.816 --> 21:55.842
We're going to take care of you.

21:55.919 --> 21:58.979
Your private personal team.

21:59.055 --> 22:02.149
Always to match your taste.

22:02.225 --> 22:04.693
We're highly motivated.

22:05.495 --> 22:08.658
We polish our minds and bodies.

22:08.732 --> 22:11.667
Tell us anything.

22:11.735 --> 22:23.340
Just want you to be
pleased, to be pleased.

22:24.481 --> 22:34.982
But, but,
what a cold-hearted man.

22:37.227 --> 22:43.359
Look, the stars are beautiful.

22:43.433 --> 22:49.269
Tomorrow sure
will be sunny, too.

22:50.073 --> 22:56.410
Tonight too, in your dream too...

22:56.479 --> 23:00.779
...we serve you.

23:10.727 --> 23:12.217
I'm going out.

23:12.295 --> 23:15.128
Be careful too,
the person behind Taro-sama.

23:15.198 --> 23:17.257
Is there someone behind me?

23:17.334 --> 23:19.859
Episode 4, Konoe Rises.

23:19.936 --> 23:20.804
We'll serve you next
time as well, Master.

23:20.804 --> 23:22.939
Next Episode
Konoe Rises
We'll serve you next
time as well, Master.

23:22.939 --> 23:24.702
Next Episode
Konoe Rises
